description	"Jedi Forcemaster

^9Weapons:
- Heavy Melee
- Martial Arts ^9(Dual Saber)
-- Saber Defense (0)
^2-- Spec Damage: 1.6x
^2-- Knockback: +.75
^2-- Radius: 8
^1-- Blaster Defense: No
^1-- Length: 24

^3Abilities:
- Force Repulse ^3[Melee CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (3)
- Sense (3)
- Mind Trick (1)
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (2)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (3)
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
^2-- Bonus: 1/5s > 40
- BP-Free Jumps
- Force-Flow Jumps
- Sense Immunity

Light side masters who forego the use of a Lightsaber in favor of martial arts and Force proficiency."